What do you mean by calibration? Moreover, RMS sound power is not
uniquely defined. RMS depends on windowing, and despite what is commonly
believed by audio-engineers, for non-stationary signals power estimation
is not straightforward. Anyway, what's your sound meter?

Best
Pietro

